//   TL.reg(prefix, {card(line,c)→html, open(box,id,done,api), state(id)→{pass,grey,best,max}, wait?(line)→bool})   handlers of ["T",id]
//   IQ.cond(name) / IQ.reg(ns, fn(rest,name))  read-only conditions for s4 (tk. bv. gate. lv.)
